            <div xml:id="d6-a1-a2">

                <pb facs="0024" n="14" xml:id="pg14"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extracts.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Eastman to Mr.
                        Adams.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Consulate,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Queenstown, Cork,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 4, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: * * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>With regard to any connivance upon my part in this matter, I can truly assert and
                    declare that I do not know of a single shipment of seamen on board of the
                    vessel, nor of the hiring or engagement of any, and have no doubt if such
                    shipments took place I should have had some information; and from the positive
                    assurances of the captain and his officers, I cannot believe that the captain or
                    his officers did, during the stay of the vessel in this port, commit the acts
                    represented to Earl Russell, as stated in his communication of the 30th of
                    November. I feel assured, from the position of the captain in the service, that
                    you will be justified in assuring Earl Russell that no such acts as have been
                    represented to him were committed, and again would fearlessly state that, so far
                    as I am concerned, I am perfectly ignorant of such alleged acts, and should not
                    be so remiss in my duty to my government as not to convey it to them, if such
                    had occurred to my knowledge.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedien servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>EDWIN G. EASTMAN, <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. F. Adams</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Minister, London.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
